From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: vigaz <pudimdebacon3@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 14:29:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] RecentsState: disable Live Tile on lamu (MT6768 HWC
 composition cost)

Removes FLAG_LIVE_TILE from the DEFAULT and MODAL_TASK states instead of
hardcoding the hasLiveTile() getter, so the underlying bitmask stays
consistent for anything reading it directly (dumps, future bit-level
comparisons).

MT6768s HWC cannot give a hardware overlay plane to a video layer that
has to be scaled+positioned live inside a Recents task snapshot at the
same time other layers are on screen, forcing full-screen GPU (Client)
composition for as long as the live tile is shown. Measured: Launcher
framestats went from normal to 75-92% janky frames with a live tile
showing a playing video. A static TaskSnapshot avoids that composition
path entirely; swipe-up/shelf gestures are unaffected (Launcher already
falls back to animating the static snapshot when live tile is off).

Change-Id: I9b3a1c83609d523056691d00bbeee223aaabc69b
---
 .../src/com/android/quickstep/fallback/RecentsState.kt    | 8 ++++++--
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/quickstep/src/com/android/quickstep/fallback/RecentsState.kt b/quickstep/src/com/android/quickstep/fallback/RecentsState.kt
index b5b1dca..fc9e668 100644
--- a/quickstep/src/com/android/quickstep/fallback/RecentsState.kt
+++ b/quickstep/src/com/android/quickstep/fallback/RecentsState.kt
@@ -282,7 +282,12 @@ open class RecentsState(@JvmField val ordinal: Int, private val mFlags: Int) :
                     FLAG_OVERVIEW_ACTIONS or
                     FLAG_SHOW_AS_GRID or
                     FLAG_SCRIM or
-                    FLAG_LIVE_TILE or
+                    // AxionOS: no FLAG_LIVE_TILE -- MT6768's HWC forces the video
+                    // layer to GPU (Client) composition when it has to be
+                    // scaled+positioned live inside a task snapshot alongside other
+                    // layers, tanking frame pacing system-wide (measured: Launcher
+                    // framestats 75-92% janky during a live tile with video). A
+                    // static TaskSnapshot avoids that composition path.
                     FLAG_RECENTS_VIEW_VISIBLE or
                     FLAG_ADD_DESK_BUTTON or
                     FLAG_SHOW_EXPLODED_DESKTOP_VIEW),
@@ -296,7 +301,6 @@ open class RecentsState(@JvmField val ordinal: Int, private val mFlags: Int) :
                     FLAG_MODAL or
                     FLAG_SHOW_AS_GRID or
                     FLAG_SCRIM or
-                    FLAG_LIVE_TILE or
                     FLAG_RECENTS_VIEW_VISIBLE or
                     FLAG_SHOW_EXPLODED_DESKTOP_VIEW),
             )
